{"id": "q_longmont_session_12_council_chamber_roster", "question": "Who's actually in the council chamber for the Session 12 fight with the Wolf?", "answer": "TL;DR: The fight in the Council Chamber involves the Players, the Wolf, Thalia, and multiple Guards (including reinforcements); no council members are explicitly confirmed present in the provided context.\n\nBased on OBSERVED and CANON facts:\n- **Players (group)** are present and actively engaged in the battle (“Party is actively in battle”).\n- **The Wolf** is explicitly in the **Council Room** and is the central adversary of the encounter.\n- **Thalia** is present (“Wolf is standing at Thalia’s shoulder”) and participates in combat after acting under the Wolf’s influence.\n- **Guards** are present in force:\n  - Some are already inside (ringing walls, engaging players).\n  - Additional guards are “being drawn here as reinforcements” to the Council Chamber.\n\nThere is **no explicit mention** of council members being physically present during the fight in this projection, despite earlier governance interactions.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Participants: Players, The Wolf, Thalia, Guards (including elite and reinforcements)\n- Location: Council Chamber (large circular room, magical defenses active)\n- מצב: Active combat with illusions, traps, and reinforcements entering", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 732, "post_filter_count": 30, "duration_ms": 24954, "top_5": [["ent_the_wolf", 2.0561], ["ent_branching_paths_after_the_fight", 1.8017], ["ent_city_council", 1.6405], ["ent_battle_with_the_wolf_in_the_council_chamber", 1.6], ["ent_arcane_locks", 1.5269]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_the_wolf", "ent_branching_paths_after_the_fight", "ent_city_council", "ent_battle_with_the_wolf_in_the_council_chamber", "ent_arcane_locks", "ent_magic_pulse_alarms", "ent_magical_alarm_system", "ent_escape_tunnel", "ent_corrupted_guard_patrol", "ent_grobnok_the_goblin", "ent_thalia", 