{"id": "q_longmont_campaign_general_notes_1", "question": "Who are the Shepherds, and what god or power do they answer to?", "answer": "TL;DR: The Shepherds are a cult group (the Shepherd’s Flock) actively recruiting and agitating in the city, and they answer to the power of **Maelthor**.\n\nThe **Shepherd’s Flock** are cultists operating openly as protesters while secretly advancing a darker agenda. They recruit vulnerable or “transformed” individuals, framing their actions as necessary to “cleanse” the world and promote **human supremacy** (CANON). They also present incidents as defensive acts against non-human threats to maintain public sympathy (OBSERVED).\n\nTheir allegiance is explicitly tied to **Maelthor**:\n- OBSERVED: They are “followers of Maelthor.”\n- OBSERVED: They are aligned with “Maelthor’s influence and emergence.”\n\nThis indicates they are not just ideological extremists, but agents of a rising or active power tied to Maelthor.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Role: Cultists staging protests and recruiting members\n- Goals: Cleanse “impurities,” enforce human supremacy, expand their ranks\n- Loyalty: Devoted to Maelthor and its growing influence\n- Activity: Public protest + covert recruitment of transformed individuals\n- Presence: Visible at city gates, distributing messaging and gathering support", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 732, "post_filter_count": 30, "duration_ms": 38381, "top_5": [["ent_shepherds_flock", 2.4918], ["ent_maelthor", 1.8], ["ent_players", 1.5104], ["ent_non_human_threats", 1.2414], ["ent_the_region", 1.2414]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_shepherds_flock", "ent_maelthor", "ent_players", "ent_non_human_threats", "ent_the_region", "ent_secure_shipment_shepherds", "ent_protesters", "ent_agility_potion", "ent_commander_thalia_ashenvale", "ent_pamphlets", "ent_towns_and_villages", "ent_arcane_instruments_and_charms", "ent_black_and_gold", "ent_burgundy_and_teal", "ent_demons", "ent_devils", "ent_healing_potions", "ent_hidden_alchemy_room", "ent_historical_atrocities_and_justifications", "ent_human_sympathizers", "ent_impact_on_local_populations", "ent_leaders_and_agitators", "ent_local_markets", "ent_magical_ribbon", "ent_mystery_potions", "ent_nearby_region", "ent_non_human_villages", "ent_ordinary_game", "ent_other_place", "ent_pack"], "semantic_rerank": {"enabled": false}, "evidence_first": {"enabled": true, "duration_ms": 38338, "top_k": 24, "neighbor_window": 1, "max_neighbors": 24, "selected_count": 61, "seeded_count": 24, "selected_evidence_ids": ["evid_18de21406ddc5ef9", "evid_efc8d28d1c119dec", "evid_e0b3b3f890cf03d8", "evid_bd33cf8ccacd4868", "evid_b79583f3fd545e35", "evid_b79583f3fd545e35", "evid_b79583f3fd545e35", "evid_b79583f3fd545e35", "evid_b79583f3fd545e35", "evid_b79583f3fd545e35", "evid_c3ba7267b3e0d97e", "evid_f77beee73251df5d", "evid_ed4c1845ab014824", "evid_b69bb6e923bd1937", "evid_65cb1223d057140a", "evid_9af2ea04cfc7e110", "evid_9af2ea04cfc7e110", "evid_40db536622e77213", "evid_40db536622e77213", "evid_769b565ecf0611d9", "evid_2864b9337d3e3550", "evid_2864b9337d3e3550", "evid_d4ee3917adf4082f", "evid_945952f5ee222f55", "evid_945952f5ee222f55", "evid_945952f5ee222f55", "evid_9af2ea04cfc7e110", "evid_2864b9337d3e3550", "evid_40db536622e77213", "evid_945952f5ee222f55", "evid_9af2ea04cfc7e110", "evid_2864b9337d3e3550", "evid_40db536622e77213", "evid_4dd621d457de05c4", "evid_23b8efb77d91c50a", "evid_945952f5ee222f55", "evid_9af2ea04cfc7e110", "evid_2864b9337d3e3550", "evid_40db536622e77213", "evid_945952f5ee222f55", "evid_9af2ea04cfc7e110", "evid_2864b9337d3e3550", "evid_40db536622e77213", "evid_043aa45b67bdb841", "evid_0567052e51a493d9", "evid_07829de77fbb3228", "evid_1339ff1ac36720f7", "evid_1fd92f50045a8272", "evid_314e0c3fe5617866", "evid_3571056a70dbe03d", "evid_508e7be9d3fcdd98", "evid_5e9f1a4931c92cc4", "evid_5ff26ef7016aa18a", "evid_6152b8d3f40d387c", "evid_87ca60b0c550f3e9", "evid_8ce139314602edcc", "evid_9800986684ebe