{"id": "q_the_city_council_4", "question": "Merril, Torrin, Rurik-what's each one's job on the council?", "answer": "TL;DR: Torrin represents the Guilds (crafts/industry), Rurik oversees infrastructure (city structure and defenses), and Merril’s council role is not defined in the provided context.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Torrin Flamescale (CANON + OBSERVED)\n  - Role: Representative of the Guilds; Master Smith\n  - Domain: Craft guilds, industry, practical city concerns\n  - Notes: Speaks bluntly on city issues; respected craftsman\n\n- Rurik Stonehammer (CANON + OBSERVED)\n  - Role: Representative of Infrastructure; Chief Architect\n  - Domain: City structure, defenses, tunnels/sewers, structural integrity\n  - Notes: Focused on sealing vulnerabilities and maintaining defenses\n\n- Merril\n  - Role: Not specified in the projection\n  - Note: The context contains no facts identifying Merril’s council job, so it cannot be determined from current data.", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 732, "post_filter_count": 30, "duration_ms": 31362, "top_5": [["ent_torrin", 2.0232], ["ent_torrin_flamescale", 2.0232], ["ent_rurik_stonehammer", 1.9226], ["ent_rurik", 1.9226], ["ent_representative_of_the_guilds", 1.6632]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_torrin", "ent_torrin_flamescale", "ent_rurik_stonehammer", "ent_rurik", "ent_representative_of_the_guilds", "ent_city_defenses", "ent_glowkindle", "ent_merril_tealeaf", "ent_merril", "ent_stonebridge", "ent_spells", "ent_the_cult", "ent_players", "ent_dwarf", "ent_city_council", "ent_potions", "ent_the_city", "ent_representative_of_infrastructure", "ent_guilds", "ent_agricultural_district", "ent_armed_groups", "ent_broken_alchemical_tools", "ent_crest_of_the_city_guard", "ent_dark_blue_tunic", "ent_earth_toned_dress", "ent_firkin_of_ale", "ent_flaming_magma_infused_spider_monstrosity", "ent_forgotten_chambers", "ent_front_door", "ent_gardening_tools"], "semantic_rerank": {"enabled": fals