{"id": "q_wolf_status", "question": "End of Session 12: is the Wolf alive, dead, still corrupted-what's his state?", "answer": "TL;DR: The Wolf is **dead** at end of Session 12—he was **“Decapitated; head removed from body”**—and he had shown clear signs of corruption prior to death.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Physical Condition (OBSERVED): **“Decapitated; head removed from body”**; previously had **“an oily sheen to his eyes.”**\n- Operational Status (OBSERVED): Includes both escape attempts and “escapes,” but these are superseded by the terminal outcome.\n- Mental State (OBSERVED): Desperate, regretful, begging for release or death.\n- Loyalty/Alignment (OBSERVED): Cult-aligned; betrayed Mirathorn.\n\nResolution of Conflicts:\nThere is a conflict between earlier escape-related statuses (e.g., invisibility, fleeing) and the final condition. The **terminal outcome “Decapitated; head removed from body”** takes precedence as the most current and definitive state. Bonogo’s role explicitly includes **removing the Wolf’s head**, reinforcing this outcome.\n\nFinal State:\n- Alive? No.\n- Corrupted? Yes, prior to death (oily sheen, cult influence).\n- Current condition: **Dead (decapitated).**", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 732, "post_filter_count": 30, "duration_ms": 48147, "top_5": [["ent_the_wolf", 1.8276], ["ent_guards", 1.7858], ["ent_battle_with_the_wolf_in_the_council_chamber", 1.6], ["ent_speak_with_dead", 1.5514], ["ent_dead_horse", 1.5454]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_the_wolf", "ent_guards", "ent_battle_with_the_wolf_in_the_council_chamber", "ent_speak_with_dead", "ent_dead_horse", "ent_knife", "ent_stafl", "ent_bonogo", "ent_stone_bridge", "ent_thalia", "ent_dead_horses_owner", "ent_session_13_the_meaty_and_the_dead", "ent_guard", "ent_stormspire_academy", "ent_out_town", "ent_sprite", "ent_necromancer", "ent_shepherds_flock_cultists", "ent_the_cult", "ent_karsemine_the_tiefling_ranger", "ent_baergrom_the_dwar